# {{NAME}}

An external oveRTOS application (Zig).

## Build

```bash
make host.posix.{{CONFIG_NAME}}     # POSIX host
make qemu.freertos.{{CONFIG_NAME}}  # QEMU + FreeRTOS

make            # download, configure, build
make run        # launch (POSIX) or boot in QEMU
```

`OVE_DIR` is set in `Makefile`. Override per invocation:

```bash
make OVE_DIR=/other/path/to/oveRTOS host.posix.{{CONFIG_NAME}} && make
```

## Layout

```
{{NAME}}/
├── Makefile         # delegates to $(OVE_DIR)/config/make/ove_app.mk
├── app.yaml         # manifest
├── build.zig        # zig build harness
├── build.zig.zon    # dependencies (ove binding path)
├── src/main.zig     # entry — comptime { ove.exportMain(appMain) }
└── output/          # generated workspace
```

## Zig version

Minimum supported Zig version: **0.15.2**. Run `zig version` to confirm. If your distro ships an older Zig, the oveRTOS build system can fetch a pinned one:

```bash
make -C $OVE_DIR ensure-toolchain-zig
```

